# Enables GitHub's "Cite this repository" button. Keep in step with the
# BibTeX block in README.md.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TargetGym in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "TargetGym: Reinforcement Learning Environments for Target MDPs"
abstract: >-
  JAX reinforcement learning environments built around target MDPs -- tasks
  where the objective is to reach and maintain a subset of states rather than
  to reach a goal and stop. Eighteen environments spanning aircraft, process,
  industrial and energy plants, each with a documented and tested physics
  contract and PID/MPC baselines.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Berthelot
    given-names: Yann
repository-code: "https://github.com/YannBerthelot/TargetGym"
url: "https://github.com/YannBerthelot/TargetGym"
license: MIT
year: 2025
keywords:
  - reinforcement-learning
  - jax
  - gymnax
  - gymnasium
  - process-control
  - simulation
